  "decisions": {
    "k-flying": {
      "decision": "created",
      "narrativeId": "n-flying-tesla-roadster",
      "reason": "Created n-flying-tesla-roadster. Six coins named for the Tesla Roadster unveiling on four covered launchpads (pump.fun, Meteora DBC, Clanker, Flap) and three chains: FTR on pump.fun ($24.5M), 特斯拉能飞 on Clanker ($10.4M), FTR on Meteora DBC ($5.1M and $1.8M), 特斯拉能飞 on Flap ($4.0M) and STARMAN ($1.4M), $47.3M combined 24h volume against the $500K bar, each with a market cap above $100K and no quarantine flag. The independent source is the event itself: posts dated 2026-10-16 from @niccruzpatane, @cb_doge and @latestinspace describe Tesla's live unveiling (e3:1), and DEXTools quotes Tesla's and Musk's posts (e3:0). Not added: the StonkFun FTR (pool created 2026-08-15, predates the story), RDSTR (market cap $47.6K, under the $100K bar) and two pump.fun FTR contracts (extreme 24h move, quarantined). This reverses the 2026-10-15 deferral (k-sym-FTR: three copies of one meme and a one-day hook): the rule as written is met, the coins now span three chains and four launchpads at $47.3M, and the owner should say whether copies of one meme should count; flagged. A cap replacement: Tokenized stocks and RWA coins leaves (see retiredNarratives)."
    },
    "k-through": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "The word \"through\" over FTR (placed in Flying Tesla Roadster coins), BURROW (a dark web launchpad on Robinhood Chain) and BOOT (a GitHub agent launchpad): no shared story beyond the one FTR is already assigned to."
    },
    "k-stocks": {
      "decision": "deferred",
      "reason": "STONK (\"Backed by stocks\", StonkFun's own coin, $6.5M), BUBBLE (\"The Official coin for all ai stocks\", $3.2M, 14 hours old) and OTC (\"earn stocks, pre-ipo, and yield\", $1.9M) share the word stocks. STONK and OTC are the Solana stock-meme pair (a 2026-09-07 @cfm_sol post compares both as \"tokenized stocks + Meme\"; @otc_labs posted its own revenue on 2026-10-15, e2:3), but BUBBLE is an AI-stock meme with no such mechanism, so only two coins share a mechanism. Not created; no cap room for a second new narrative, since the cap replacement went to Flying Tesla Roadster. Re-evaluate; flagged for the owner."
    },
    "k-created": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "The word \"created\" over GOAT (the 2024 truth_terminal meme), BOOT and MVP (a crypto analytics terminal): three unrelated coins; the story search (e2:2) returned GOAT11 call-group posts and prop-firm ads."
    },
    "k-earn": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "The word \"earn\" over OTC (earn stocks), GP (RuneScape Gold), HRX (trading agents that earn), VCAT (hold VCAT, earn VVV) and HEDGE (a stock treasury that lends and writes covered calls): different products with no shared mechanism."
    },
    "k-robinhood": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "BURROW (a dark web launchpad), IRIDIUS (swaps for Robinhood Stock Tokens) and SECTORAL (encrypted on-chain banking) share the word Robinhood only; the stock-token coins that belong together (IRIDIUS, HEDGE) sat with Tokenized stocks, which left at the cap today, and none is a new story."
    }
